@startuml
title FE-13 Create Contextless or Design-Context Conversation
actor Member
participant ConsultationController
participant ConsultationContextService
participant ConsultationApplicationService
participant WorkshopDesignContextPort
participant IndependentDesignRequestContextPort
database ConsultationConversationRepository
Member -> ConsultationController : create optional context conversation
ConsultationController -> ConsultationContextService : validate context if supplied
alt Feature-012 design context
  ConsultationContextService -> WorkshopDesignContextPort : validate owned current version
else Feature-004 request context
  ConsultationContextService -> IndependentDesignRequestContextPort : validate owned request/version
else no context
  ConsultationContextService --> ConsultationController : empty context accepted
end
ConsultationContextService --> ConsultationApplicationService : safe immutable context snapshot
ConsultationApplicationService -> ConsultationConversationRepository : create OPEN conversation
ConsultationController --> Member : conversation reference and safe context
@enduml
